---
title: "InvestiQ India — The Complete Guide to Earning, Investing, Protecting & Passing On Wealth"
description: "Comprehensive, evidence-led Indian personal finance guide and audiobook collection."
---

<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
  <head>
    <meta charset="UTF-8" />
    <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0" />
    <title>InvestiQ India — Complete Personal Finance Field Guide</title>
    <style>
      :root {
        --bg-color: #0d1117;
        --card-bg: #161b22;
        --text-primary: #e6edf3;
        --text-muted: #8b949e;
        --accent: #2ea043;
        --accent-hover: #3fb950;
        --border-color: #30363d;
      }
      body {
        margin: 0;
        font-family: -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, "Segoe UI", Roboto, "Helvetica Neue", Arial, sans-serif;
        background-color: var(--bg-color);
        color: var(--text-primary);
        line-height: 1.6;
      }
      header {
        border-bottom: 1px solid var(--border-color);
        padding: 1.5rem 2rem;
        display: flex;
        justify-content: space-between;
        align-items: center;
      }
      .logo {
        font-weight: 700;
        font-size: 1.4rem;
        color: #ffffff;
        letter-spacing: -0.5px;
      }
      .logo span {
        color: var(--accent);
      }
      .container {
        max-width: 1100px;
        margin: 0 auto;
        padding: 3rem 1.5rem;
      }
      .hero {
        text-align: center;
        padding: 2rem 0;
      }
      .hero h1 {
        font-size: 2.75rem;
        margin-bottom: 1rem;
        line-height: 1.2;
      }
      .hero p {
        font-size: 1.25rem;
        color: var(--text-muted);
        max-width: 750px;
        margin: 0 auto 2rem auto;
      }
      .grid {
        display: grid;
        grid-template-columns: repeat(auto-fit, minmax(320px, 1fr));
        gap: 1.5rem;
        margin-top: 2rem;
      }
      .card {
        background: var(--card-bg);
        border: 1px solid var(--border-color);
        border-radius: 8px;
        padding: 1.5rem;
        transition: transform 0.2s, border-color 0.2s;
      }
      .card:hover {
        border-color: var(--accent);
        transform: translateY(-2px);
      }
      .card h3 {
        margin-top: 0;
        color: #fff;
      }
      .card p {
        color: var(--text-muted);
        font-size: 0.95rem;
      }
      .badge {
        display: inline-block;
        padding: 0.25rem 0.6rem;
        font-size: 0.75rem;
        font-weight: 600;
        border-radius: 999px;
        background: rgba(46, 160, 67, 0.15);
        color: var(--accent-hover);
        margin-bottom: 0.75rem;
      }
      footer {
        border-top: 1px solid var(--border-color);
        text-align: center;
        padding: 2.5rem 1rem;
        color: var(--text-muted);
        font-size: 0.85rem;
      }
    </style>
  </head>
  <body>
    <header>
      <div class="logo">InvestiQ <span>India</span></div>
      <nav>
        <span class="badge">FY 2026-27 Compliant</span>
      </nav>
    </header>

    <main class="container">
      <section class="hero">
        <h1>Your Indian Money &amp; Wealth Field Guide</h1>
        <p>A deep, evidence-led guide to earning, investing, protecting, and transferring wealth in India. Designed for both visual reading and natural Moon+ Reader TTS narration.</p>
      </section>

      <section class="grid">
        <div class="card">
          <div class="badge">Master Outline</div>
          <h3>18 Parts, 150+ Chapters</h3>
          <p>From India's wealth landscape and software-engineering career compounding to debt triage, mutual funds, real estate, inheritance laws, and decumulation.</p>
        </div>

        <div class="card">
          <div class="badge">Calculators &amp; Planners</div>
          <h3>60+ Client-Side Financial Tools</h3>
          <p>XIRR, New vs Old Tax Regime (FY 2026-27), Debt Avalanche/Snowball, Step-up SIP, and Monte Carlo sustainability. Zero server data transmission.</p>
        </div>

        <div class="card">
          <div class="badge">Audiobook-Friendly</div>
          <h3>Moon+ Reader Pro TTS Ready</h3>
          <p>EPUB 3.3 outputs with natural spoken representations for equations, rupee values, tables, and tax provisions.</p>
        </div>
      </section>
    </main>

    <footer>
      <p>InvestiQ India &copy; 2026. Non-commercial educational resource. Code under MIT, Text under CC BY-NC-SA 4.0. Author: Chirag Singhal.</p>
      <p>Disclaimer: For educational purposes only. Does not constitute registered financial, legal, or tax advice.</p>
    </footer>
  </body>
</html>
